ocal, Pipa, Synthesizer, Melancholic, Cinematic, Sad, Atmospheric"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 21, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 29, "type": "ShowText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [23], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [378.764404296875, 271.428466796875], "pos": [589.925048828125, 3150.22998046875], "widgets_values": ["Lyrics:\n[Intro] [Ethereal synthesizer pads, Delicate pipa plucking, Atmospheric and lonely]\n\n[Verse 1] [Introspective vocal, Soft intensity, Narrative progression]\n有些爱像断线纸鸢 结局悲余手中线\n有些恨像是一个圈 冤冤相报不了结\n只为了完成一个夙愿 还将付出几多鲜血\n忠义之言 自欺欺人的谎言\n\n[Verse 2] [Slightly building intensity, Whispering vocal texture]\n有些情入苦难回绵 窗间月夕夕成玦\n有些仇心藏却无言 腹化风雪为刀剑\n只为了完成一个夙愿 荒乱中邪正如何辨\n飞沙狼烟将乱我 徒有悲添\n\n[Chorus] [High energy, Emotional climax, Powerful ethereal vocal, Orchestral hybrid]\n半城烟沙 兵临池下\n金戈铁马 替谁争天下\n一将成 万骨枯 多少白发送走黑发\n半城烟沙 随风而下\n手中还有 一缕牵挂\n只盼归田卸甲 还能捧回你沏的茶\n\n[Verse 3] [Subtle pulse, Melancholic pipa melody]\n有些情入苦难回绵 窗间月夕夕成玦\n有些仇心藏却无言 腹化风雪为刀剑\n爱 爱 爱 为了一个夙愿 荒乱中邪正如何辨\n飞沙狼烟将乱我 徒有悲添\n\n[Chorus] [Triumphant yet sorrowful, Explosive vocal, Rich synthesizer layers]\n半城烟沙 兵临池下\n金戈铁马 替谁争天下\n一将成 万骨枯 多少白发送走黑发\n半城烟沙 随风而下\n手中还有 一缕牵挂\n只盼归田卸甲 还能捧回你沏的茶\n\n[Bridge] [Dramatic build-up, Fast pipa tremolo, Intense atmosphere]\n半城烟沙 兵临池下\n金戈铁马 替谁争天下\n一将成 万骨枯 多少白发送走黑发\n\n[Chorus] [Maximum emotional release, Sorrowful vocal expression]\n半城烟沙 血泪落下\n残骑裂甲 铺红天涯\n转世燕还故榻 为你衔来二月的花\n\n[Outro] [Fading synthesizer, Final lingering pipa note, Ethereal hum]\n(Instrumental fading)"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 22, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 30, "type": "ShowText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "list_output", "label": "list_output", "type"